Reformats the supplementary appendix for PVLDB. main.tex was reformatted for the venue and
appendix.tex was not, so the supplement renders "Anonymous Author(s)", declares
SIGMOD/PODS '27 as its conference, and cites the "SIGMOD/PACMMOD appendix policy" as the
reason reviewers need not read it -- while the main paper is single-blind PVLDB with seven
named authors. See docs/GAP_AUDIT.md O29.

Five changes, all in the front matter:
  1. the banner comment: SIGMOD/PACMMOD double-blind -> PVLDB Vol. 20
  2. \documentclass[sigconf,anonymous] -> [sigconf,nonacm], matching main.tex
  3. drops \acmConference/\acmYear/\acmDOI/\acmISBN -- main.tex sets none of these and
     nonacm suppresses the block
  4. restores the author block, mirroring main.tex
  5. the abstract's policy sentence -> PVLDB

Verify before applying:
  cd overleaf/sdc_llm_icml_2025
  git apply --check ../../trainaudit-vldb-artifact/docs/patches/03-appendix-vldb-format.patch
Then rebuild: pdflatex -shell-escape appendix.tex (x2 with bibtex between).

